\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000\"><b></b></span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 224px\">\n<td style=\"width: 34.8366%;text-align: center;height: 224px\" colspan=\"4\">\n<h3><span style=\"color: #008000\"><strong>Important Dates</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\">Application Begin : <strong>01/07/2026</strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\">Last Date for Apply : <span style=\"color: #ff0000\"><b>21/07/2026</b></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\">Fee Payment Last Date : <b>21/07/2026</b></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\">Correction Date : <strong>25-28 July 2026</strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\">NEET PG 2026 Exam Date : <strong>30/08/2026</strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\">Exam City Available : <strong>11/08/2026</strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\">Admit Card Available : <strong>25/08/2026</strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\">Result Declared : <strong>30/09/2026</strong></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 31.5577%;text-align: center;height: 224px\" colspan=\"2\">\n<h3><span style=\"color: #008000\"><strong>Application Fees</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\">General / OBC / EWS : <b>3500/-</b></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\">SC / ST / PH: <b>2500/-</b></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\">Pay the Examination Fee Through Debit Card / Credit Card / Net Banking / Online Only.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 104px\">\n<td style=\"width: 66.3943%;height: 104px\" colspan=\"6\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000\"><b>NEET Post Graduate PG Courses Admission 2026 : </b></span><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\"><b>Eligibility &amp; Course Details</b></span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px\">\n<td style=\"text-align: center;width: 26.4017%;height: 25px\" colspan=\"2\"><strong>Post Name</strong></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;width: 8.43489%;height: 25px\" colspan=\"4\"><strong>NEET PG 2026 Eligibility Details</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;width: 26.4017%\" colspan=\"2\">NEET PG 2026 MD MS PG Diploma</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;width: 8.43489%\" colspan=\"4\">\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\">MBBS Degree in Any Recognized Institute.</li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\">For More Details Read the Notification.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 66.3943%\" colspan=\"6\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000\"><b>Document Required for NEET PG Admission Application Form 2026</b></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><b>Scan Photo :</b> &nbsp;Passport Size Photograph with White Background<b> </b></li>\n<li><b>Real Time Photograph :</b> For real time photo, candidate must have webcam / in-built camera in Laptop / Desktop, one thing to keep in mind is background should be white.</li>\n<li><b>Scan Signature :</b> Running Hand Signature in Black / Blue Pen with Good Quality Scan.</li>\n<li><strong>Thumb Impression :</strong> Scan Good Quality Thumb Print in Black / Blue Ink.</li>\n<li>For More Details Read the Notification for NEET PG 2026.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px\">\n<td style=\"height: 25px\" colspan=\"6\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000\"><b>How to Fill </b></span><span style=\"color: #008000\"><b>NEET PG Entrance Exam </b></span><span style=\"color: #008000\"><b><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\">Online Form 2026</span></b></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>National Board of Examinations in Medical Sciences Released the NEET PG Admission Form 2026. Candidate Can Apply Between <b>01 July 2026 to 21 July 2026.<br>\n</b></li>\n<li>Candidate Read the Notification Before Apply the Admission Application Form in NEET PG Form 2026.</li>\n<li>Kindly Check and College the All Document – Eligibility, ID Proof, Address Details, Basic Details.</li>\n<li>Kindly Ready Scan Document Related to Recruitment Form – Photo, Sign, ID Proof, Etc.</li>\n<li>Before Submit the Application Form Must Check the Preview and All Column Carefully.</li>\n<li>Take A Print Out of Final Submitted Form.</li>\n<li>For the latest updates on Sarkari Result, admit card, answer key, and result, always visit SarkariResult.com, the official website for Sarkari Result in India (Since 2012).</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px\">\n<td style=\"width: 66.3943%;height: 25px\" colspan=\"6\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\"><b>Interested Candidates Can Read the Full Notification Before Apply Online</b></span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px\">\n<td style=\"width: 66.3943%;height: 25px\" colspan=\"6\">\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px\">\n<td style=\"width: 34.8366%;height: 25px;text-align: center\" colspan=\"4\">\n\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 31.5577%;height: 25px;text-align: center\" colspan=\"2\">\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px\">\n<td style=\"width: 66.3943%;height: 25px;text-align: center\" colspan=\"6\">\n<h2><span style=\"color: #008000\"><strong>Some Useful Important Links</strong></span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center\" colspan=\"4\">\n<h2><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\"><strong>Download Admit Card</strong></span></h2>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center\" colspan=\"2\">\n<h2><a title=\"Download Admit Card 2026\" href=\"https://cdn3.digialm.com/EForms/configuredHtml/1815/94357/login.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center\" colspan=\"4\">\n<h2><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\"><strong>Download Admit Card Notice</strong></span></h2>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center\" colspan=\"2\">\n<h2><a title=\"Download Admit Card Notice 2026\" href=\"https://natboard.edu.in/viewNotice.php?NBE=b1lWdENZZFFpVHVjcWFKTm9VdEcwQT09\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center\" colspan=\"4\">\n<h2><span style=\"color: #ff00ff