ata-start=\"555\" data-end=\"592\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\"><strong>3. Where can I find the syllabus for the NEET PG 2026 Examination?</strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"593\" data-end=\"655\">The detailed syllabus and examination scheme for the NEET PG 2026 Examination are available in the official notification. Candidates are advised to read the notification carefully for complete syllabus details.</li>\n</ul>\n<h5 style=\"text-align: left\" data-section-id=\"o0mtqe\" data-start=\"555\" data-end=\"592\"><span style=\"color: #008000\"><strong>4. NEET PG 2026 Admissions Notification PDF?</strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"593\" data-end=\"655\">Candidates can download the notification through SarkariResult.com.</li>\n</ul>\n<h5 style=\"text-align: left\" data-section-id=\"kyy6a2\" data-start=\"180\" data-end=\"221\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\"><strong>5. NEET PG 2026 Admissions Last Date?</strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"222\" data-end=\"305\">The last date to apply online is <strong>21 July 2026.</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<h5 style=\"text-align: left\" data-section-id=\"1dih1sd\" data-start=\"307\" data-end=\"359\"><span style=\"color: #008000\"><strong>6. What is the last date to Update application fee Details?</strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"360\" data-end=\"433\">Candidates can pay the application fee up to <strong data-start=\"742\" data-end=\"758\">21 July 2026</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h5 style=\"text-align: left\" data-section-id=\"o0mtqe\" data-start=\"555\" data-end=\"592\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\"><strong>7. How can I apply for NEET PG 2026 Exam?</strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"593\" data-end=\"655\">Candidates can apply online through the official recruitment link available on <strong data-start=\"1262\" data-end=\"1334\"><strong data-start=\"1262\" data-e